00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:42.950
Part two, the men are at sea when a big storm begins.

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:48.950
The wind is blowing hard, and the big waves almost go over the top of the boat.

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:51.950
The men are all very afraid.

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:54.950
A man is steering the boat.

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:59.950
