00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:05.950
They must leave the ship to save themselves.

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:08.950
There is a small island not too far away.

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:14.950
The men don't know this, and they don't know it is a magic tempest.

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:18.950
From a distance, Prospero is watching the storm.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:23.950
His magic is working well, but Ariel's work is not finished.

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:30.000
Prospero has plans for the men, but first, they must arrive on the island.

