00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:49.950
Oh, no. I hear a voice.

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:55.950
It is probably a bad spirit from Prospero.

00:21:56.000 --> 00:22:00.950
I must hide.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:04.950
What a beautiful island. And what is this?

00:22:05.000 --> 00:22:08.950
